Package: tennisrpkg
Title: A package to analyze and plot tennis data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Esteban", "Lopez", email = "estebanlopez@berkeley.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Retrieves the career matches of a given player (e.g. Serena Williams, Rafael Nadal) from tennisabstract.com, and makes a plot like the NYT’s data visualization of HW2 (ignoring annotations).
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: 
    jsonlite,
    ggplot2,
    dplyr,
    stringr
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3

